   "subject": "Treatment effects with latent covariates: continuous vs discrete measures",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Hi everyone, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">I have been trying to wrap my head around this for a while now and decided to try to get some help from the community. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">I&#39;m currently estimating the effect of a treatment (A and B) on performance scores, and I want to understand if this effect is mediated by some latent variables.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Essentially, I am estimating three different models:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">1.<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">          </span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Base Model to Understand Treatment Effect without Mediators</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Measurement model:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var1 =~ item1 + item2 + item3</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var2 =~ item4 + item5 + item6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var3 =~ item7 + item8 + item9</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var4 =~ item10 + item11 + item12 + item13 + item14 + item15 + item16 + item17</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var5 =~ item18 + item19 + item20 + item21 + item22 + item23</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf =~ measure1 + measure2 + measure3 + measure4 + measure5 + measure6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Regressions:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">2.<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">          </span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Model Including Mediators in the Regression</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Measurement model:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var1 =~ item1 + item2 + item3</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var2 =~ item4 + item5 + item6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var3 =~ item7 + item8 + item9</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var4 =~ item10 + item11 + item12 + item13 + item14 + item15 + item16 + item17</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var5 =~ item18 + item19 + item20 + item21 + item22 + item23</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf =~ measure1 + measure2 + measure3 + measure4 + measure5 + measure6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Regressions:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf ~ A + B + Var1 + Var2 + Var3 + Var4 + Var5</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\"> </span></i></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">3.<span style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">          </span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Model Including the Impact of Treatment on Mediators</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Measurement model:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var1 =~ item1 + item2 + item3</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var2 =~ item4 + item5 + item6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var3 =~ item7 + item8 + item9</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var4 =~ item10 + item11 + item12 + item13 + item14 + item15 + item16 + item17</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var5 =~ item18 + item19 + item20 + item21 + item22 + item23</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf =~ measure1 + measure2 + measure3 + measure4 + measure5 + measure6</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Regressions:</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Perf ~ A + B + Var1 + Var2 + Var3 + Var4 + Var5</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var1 ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var2 ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var3 ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var4 ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Var5 ~ A + B</span></i></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">The strange thing is that in Model 1, the standardized effect of treatment A on Perf is 0.8 SD. In Model 2, it is 0.9 SD, and in Model 3, it is 0.2 SD. What doesn&#39;t make sense to me is that if, as seen in Model 3, the effect of the treatment on the mediators is positive, and the mediators in turn have a positive effect on the outcome, I would expect the coefficient of Perf in Model 2 to be lower compared to Model 1. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(12,12,12);font-size:10pt\">Moreover, this issue only occurs when I specify the measures of Var1, Var2, Var3, Var4, and Var5 as categorical. When I treat them as continuous, the coefficient of A in Model 2 decreases compared to Model 1 (as I would expect).</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Any insights on why this discrepancy occurs?</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Thanks in advance for your help!</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:medium;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(12,12,12)\">Emma</span></p>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
